<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>系统设置 — AUTO PARTS FACTORY</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root{--main:#0A2F5F;--blue:#1E6BD9;--accent:#F59E0B;--light:#F3F4F6;--gray:#E5E7EB;--r:10px;}
    *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;}
    body{background:var(--light);display:flex;min-height:100vh;color:#1F2937;}
    .sidebar{width:220px;background:var(--main);color:#fff;position:fixed;top:0;bottom:0;left:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;}
    .s-top{padding:22px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);}
    .s-top h2{font-size:17px;font-weight:700;}
    .s-top p{font-size:12px;opacity:.7;margin-top:4px;}
    .s-menu{padding:16px 0;flex:1;}
    .s-menu a{display:block;padding:11px 20px;margin:3px 10px;border-radius:8px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.85);font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;}
    .s-menu a:hover,.s-menu a.active{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;}
    .s-bot{padding:16px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);}
    .s-bot a{color:#FCA5A5;font-size:13px;text-decoration:none;}
    .main{flex:1;margin-left:220px;padding:24px;}
    .top-bar{background:#fff;padding:16px 22px;border-radius:var(--r);margin-bottom:22px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;box-shadow:0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.04);}
    .top-bar h1{font-size:18px;font-weight:600;color:var(--main);}
    .btn{display:inline-block;padding:9px 18px;border-radius:7px;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;text-decoration:none;}
    .btn-blue{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;}
    .btn-green{background:#10B981;color:#fff;}
    .card{background:#fff;border-radius:var(--r);padding:22px;margin-bottom:22px;box-shadow:0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.04);}
    .card h3{font-size:15px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:18px;padding-bottom:12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--gray);color:var(--main);}
    input,textarea{width:100%;padding:9px 12px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;border-radius:7px;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:8px;outline:none;}
    label{display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;color:#4B5563;margin-bottom:5px;}
    .tip{font-size:11px;color:#9CA3AF;margin-bottom:14px;}
    .ok{background:#ECFDF5;color:#065F46;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:7px;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:13px;}
    .row2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;}
    .row3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:12px;}
    .social-preview{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:8px;margin-bottom:12px;}
    .social-preview a{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid #E5E7EB;overflow:hidden;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:#F9FAFB;}
    .social-preview img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;}
    @media(max-width:768px){.sidebar{display:none}.main{margin-left:0}.row2,.row3{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <aside class="sidebar">
    <div class="s-top">
      <h2>管理后台</h2>
      <p>欢迎，<%= admin.username %></p>
    </div>
    <nav class="s-menu">
      <a href="/admin/product">📦 产品管理</a>
      <a href="/admin/category">📁 分类管理</a>
      <a href="/admin/factory">🏭 工厂展示</a>
      <a href="/admin/inquiry">💬 客户询盘</a>
      <a href="/admin/stats">📊 数据统计</a>
      <a href="/admin/settings" class="active">⚙️ 系统设置</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="s-bot"><a href="/admin/logout">🚪 退出登录</a></div>
  </aside>

  <main class="main">
    <div class="top-bar">
      <h1>⚙️ 系统设置</h1>
      <a href="/" target="_blank" class="btn btn-blue">🌐 查看前台</a>
    </div>

    <% if(typeof saved !== 'undefined' && saved){ %><div class="ok">✅ 保存成功，前台已同步</div><% } %>

    <form method="post" action="/admin/settings">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>基础信息</h3>
        <label>网站名称</label>
        <input type="text" name="site_name" value="<%= config.site_name || 'AUTO PARTS FACTORY' %>">
        <label>公司名称</label>
        <input type="text" name="company_name" value="<%= config.company_name || '' %>">
        <label>联系邮箱</label>
        <input type="email" name="contact_email" value="<%= config.contact_email || '' %>">
        <label>WhatsApp（带国际区号）</label>
        <input type="text" name="contact_whatsapp" value="<%= config.contact_whatsapp || '+85264960641' %>">
        <label>版权文字</label>
        <input type="text" name="copyright_text" value="<%= config.copyright_text || '© AUTO PARTS FACTORY' %>">
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>页面底图设置</h3>
        <label>① Hero 顶部大图背景</label>
        <input type="url" name="hero_bg" value="<%= config.hero_bg || '' %>" placeholder="https://...">
        <p class="tip">建议尺寸 1920×800</p>
        <label>② 产品展示区背景图</label>
        <input type="url" name="products_bg" value="<%= config.products_bg || '' %>" placeholder="https://...">
        <p class="tip">建议尺寸 1200×600，不填则使用浅色渐变</p>
        <label>③ 工厂轮播图片（逗号分隔）</label>
        <textarea name="factory_images" rows="3" placeholder="https://img1.jpg,https://img2.jpg"><%= config.factory_images || '' %></textarea>
        <p class="tip">最多 5 张，英文逗号分隔</p>
        <label>④ 工厂轮播延时（秒）</label>
        <input type="number" name="carousel_delay" value="<%= config.carousel_delay || 4.5 %>" min="2" max="15" step="0.5">
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>联系我们下方三个圆形图标（图片 + 跳转链接）</h3>
        <p class="tip">前台页脚「联系我们」下方显示三个可点击圆圈，可放微信/社媒/官网等图标</p>
        <div class="row3">
          <div>
            <label>圆圈1 图片URL</label>
            <input type="url" name="social1_img" value="<%= config.social1_img || '' %>" placeholder="https://...">
            <label>圆圈1 跳转链接</label>
            <input type="url" name="social1_url" value="<%= config.social1_url || '' %>" placeholder="https://...">
          </div>
          <div>
            <label>圆圈2 图片URL</label>
            <input type="url" name="social2_img" value="<%= config.social2_img || '' %>" placeholder="https://...">
            <label>圆圈2 跳转链接</label>
            <input type="url" name="social2_url" value="<%= config.social2_url || '' %>" placeholder="https://...">
          </div>
          <div>
            <label>圆圈3 图片URL</label>
            <input type="url" name="social3_img" value="<%= config.social3_img || '' %>" placeholder="https://...">
            <label>圆圈3 跳转链接</label>
            <input type="url" name="social3_url" value="<%= config.social3_url || '' %>" placeholder="https://...">
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="social-preview">
          <% if(config.social1_img){ %><a href="<%= config.social1_url||'#' %>" target="_blank"><img src="<%= config.social1_img %>" alt=""></a><% } %>
          <% if(config.social2_img){ %><a href="<%= config.social2_url||'#' %>" target="_blank"><img src="<%= config.social2_img %>" alt=""></a><% } %>
          <% if(config.social3_img){ %><a href="<%= config.social3_url||'#' %>" target="_blank"><img src="<%= config.social3_img %>" alt=""></a><% } %>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>货币汇率（相对 1 港币 HKD）</h3>
        <p class="tip">产品价格以港币为基准存储，前台切换货币时按此汇率自动换算，无需改产品价格。可按最新汇率自行调整。</p>
        <div class="row2">
          <div>
            <label>1 HKD = ? USD（美金）</label>
            <input type="number" name="rate_usd" value="<%= config.rate_usd || '0.128' %>" step="0.0001" min="0">
          </div>
          <div>
            <label>1 HKD = ? CNY（人民币）</label>
            <input type="number" name="rate_cny" value="<%= config.rate_cny || '0.93' %>" step="0.0001" min="0">
          </div>
          <div>
            <label>1 HKD = ? KRW（韩元）</label>
            <input type="number" name="rate_krw" value="<%= config.rate_krw || '175' %>" step="0.01" min="0">
          </div>
          <div>
            <label>1 HKD = ? JPY（日元）</label>
            <input type="number" name="rate_jpy" value="<%= config.rate_jpy || '19.2' %>" step="0.01" min="0">
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <button type="submit" class="btn btn-green">💾 保存所有设置</button>
    </form>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
